title: "ProofTTL — Source-Backed Claim Verification"
type: software
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-08-21"
url: "https://proofttl-web.vercel.app/"
repository-code: "https://github.com/tasx13ok-create/proofttl-web"
abstract: >-
  ProofTTL is a source-backed claim verification and fact-checking service
  for high-stakes factual claims, including AI-generated claims. It checks
  scoped claims against public evidence and returns SUPPORTED, CONTRADICTED,
  or UNKNOWN verdicts with evidence and signed Fact Leases.
keywords:
  - ProofTTL
  - claim verification
  - fact checking
  - AI claim verification
  - source-backed verification
  - Fact Leases
  - verification audit
